|_|_|_AggregateExec: mode=Final, gby=[], aggr=[__count_merge(__count_state(n2.ts)) as count(Int64(1))] REDACTED
|_|_|_CoalescePartitionsExec REDACTED
|_|_|_AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[], aggr=[__count_merge(__count_state(n2.ts)) as count(Int64(1))] REDACTED
|_|_|_RepartitionExec: partitioning=REDACTED
|_|_|_MergeScanExec: REDACTED
|_|_|_|
| 1_| 0_|_ProjectionExec: expr=[{count[count]:2} as __count_state(n2.ts)] REDACTED
|_|_|_PlaceholderRowExec REDACTED
|_|_|_|
| 1_| 1_|_ProjectionExec: expr=[{count[count]:2} as __count_state(n2.ts)] REDACTED
|_|_|_PlaceholderRowExec REDACTED
